SA-REACH-01.pre_declared_reading_verbatim:
3. **Pre-declared reading of the NGC3198 outer rows.** A miss reads three ways:
   - failure of the model at L=4;
   - missing reach, from L=4 interpolation or the unmixed sampler;
   - the missing Bind-history or collective component (SA-BH-01).
   A miss is never reported as a failure of UNT in general.
